-------------Expire---------------------
---expire <= '1' when (count_internal = terminal_count)	else	'0';
+-- done_gen: vl=N keeps done='0' for exactly N cycles (count = 0 .. N-1).
+-- terminal_count = vl-1 is the index of the LAST element, so done must only
+-- assert once count has gone past it (">"). The earlier ">=" dropped the last
+-- element for every vl>1 (vl=8 ran 7 elements); the started_r gate below only
+-- hid that for vl=1.
